('1ahklt4nmi','2026-11-02 16:57:55.395390','2026-11-02 16:57:55.395390','Administrator','Administrator',0,6,'offer_rebook','ask_guest','Offer to rebook','If dates changed, offer to create a new booking before they leave the desk.','Would you like me to book new dates while you\'re here?',0,60,'Sunrise::cancel','steps','SOP Template'),
('1ahp1akjhf','2026-11-02 16:57:55.342234','2026-11-02 16:57:55.342234','Administrator','Administrator',0,8,'farewell','ask_guest','Wish farewell','Thank the guest, hand over any deposit refund, and wish them a safe journey.','Thank you for staying with us, safe travels, and we hope to welcome you again.',0,80,'Sunrise::checkout','steps','SOP Template'),
