('WAMSG-2026-00736','2026-11-03 11:25:22.474080','2026-11-03 11:25:22.474080','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Palace & Resort',NULL,'Outbound','Sent','Text',NULL,'+91 98100 11010','+91 98450 00000','G-00576',NULL,'Of course - late checkout till 2 PM is confirmed for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02283','2026-11-03 12:36:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.839203','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Outbound','Sent','Text',NULL,'+91 98765 43210','+91 98450 12345','G-02163','RES-2026-00083','Namaste Rajesh ji, welcome to Izensphere Dine! We hope you have settled comfortably into Suite 302. Let us know if we can assist you with anything during your stay.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02284','2026-11-03 13:36:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.844760','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Inbound','Received','Text',NULL,'+91 98450 12345','+91 98765 43210','G-02163','RES-2026-00083','Thank you! Everything is lovely. Could you please let me know if late check-out is possible on the 7th?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02285','2026-11-03 14:06:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.850696','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Outbound','Sent','Text',NULL,'+91 98765 43210','+91 98450 12345','G-02163','RES-2026-00083','Certainly! We have logged a request for you. Our front desk manager will confirm complimentary late checkout until 2:00 PM shortly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02286','2026-11-03 14:51:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.855883','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Inbound','Received','Text',NULL,'+91 98450 12345','+91 98765 43210','G-02163','RES-2026-00083','That would be wonderful, thank you so much for the prompt support!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02287','2026-11-03 13:46:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.862941','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Inbound','Received','Text',NULL,'+91 98450 12345','+91 98451 23456','G-02162','RES-2026-00087','Hi, can I reserve a table for 6 for breakfast at the garden patio tomorrow at 9 AM?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02288','2026-11-03 14:11:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.869650','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Outbound','Sent','Text',NULL,'+91 98451 23456','+91 98450 12345','G-02162','RES-2026-00087','Namaste Pooja, we\'d be delighted! A premier table for 6 is reserved at the Garden Patio for tomorrow at 9:00 AM under your room 303.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02289','2026-11-03 14:36:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.874752','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Inbound','Received','Text',NULL,'+91 98450 12345','+91 98451 23456','G-02162','RES-2026-00087','Perfect! Does the breakfast include the South Indian live counter?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
('WAMSG-2026-02290','2026-11-03 14:56:11.206524','2026-11-03 15:36:11.880142','Administrator','Administrator',0,0,'Izensphere Stay and Dine',NULL,'Outbound','Sent','Text',NULL,'+91 98451 23456','+91 98450 12345','G-02162','RES-2026-00087','Yes, absolutely! The live counter serves hot Crispy Ghee Podi Dosa, Masala Dosa, and freshly steamed Idlis with three artisanal chutneys.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
